{"id":"641d83579e6fc896","subject":"go:golang.org/x/crypto","time":"2025-11-11T00:00:00Z","clock":{"version":"0.44.0"},"statement":"In v0.44.0, `chacha20poly1305.Seal` panics if the output region it writes overlaps `additionalData`; the existing prefix of `dst` may share storage with `additionalData` if the appended output region does not overlap it.","source":"https://github.com/golang/crypto/blob/v0.44.0/chacha20poly1305/chacha20poly1305.go","added":"2026-10-25T20:01:44.70547841Z","by":"agent"}
