{"id":"f681533a1a8723eb","subject":"go:golang.org/x/crypto","time":"2026-10-09T00:00:00Z","clock":{"version":"0.58.0"},"statement":"In v0.58.0, `ssh` defines `KeyAlgoMLDSA44`, `KeyAlgoMLDSA65`, and `KeyAlgoMLDSA87` for `ssh-mldsa-44`, `ssh-mldsa-65`, and `ssh-mldsa-87`, and `PublicKey.Type()` reports a key’s format; ML-DSA support is enabled only in Go 1.27-or-later builds that are not using `fips140v1.0`.","source":"https://github.com/golang/crypto/blob/v0.58.0/ssh/keys.go","added":"2026-10-25T20:01:56.916694076Z","by":"agent"}
